2766c927 [gemini-3.7-flash] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.2 gemini-3.7-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.006 3.537KB 5.90s
2766c927 [gemini-3.7-flash] #The log shows 6502 bus activity captured from the 1541 disk drive.
2766c928 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
2766c928 [gemini-3.7-flash] #Trace Analysis
2766c928 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
2766c928 [gemini-3.7-flash] #Each entry contains three fields:
2766c929 [gemini-3.7-flash] #1. Address/Control word (4 hex digits): Encodes the lower address lines along with
2766c929 [gemini-3.7-flash] #control/status pins.
2766c929 [gemini-3.7-flash] #2. Data bus (2 hex digits): Shows instructions and immediate data being fetched on the 6502
2766c929 [gemini-3.7-flash] #bus.
2766c92a [gemini-3.7-flash] #3. Timestamp (4 hex digits): Monotonically increasing timer counter to measure bus cycle
2766c92a [gemini-3.7-flash] #duration.
2766c92a [gemini-3.7-flash] #
2766c92a [gemini-3.7-flash] #Observed 6502 Instruction Patterns
2766c92b [gemini-3.7-flash] #
2766c92b [gemini-3.7-flash] #Looking at the data stream, several standard 6502 operations and loop sequences are visible:
2766c92b [gemini-3.7-flash] #
2766c92b [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `88` (`DEY`) — Decrement Y register.
2766c92c [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `D0 FC` (`BNE -4`) — Relative branch back 4 bytes (a tight delay/polling loop).
2766c92c [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `69 01` (`ADC #01`) — Add with carry immediate `01`.
2766c92c [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `29` / `A8` / `B8` — `AND` immediate, `TAY`, etc.
2766c92c [gemini-3.7-flash] #
2766c92d [gemini-3.7-flash] #The timestamps increment by roughly `0500` to `0514` ticks between full cycles, consistent with a
2766c92d [gemini-3.7-flash] #hardware sample counter running at a fixed frequency relative to the drive's ~1 MHz clock.
2766c92d [gemini-3.7-flash] #
2766c92d [gemini-3.7-flash] #Please let me know how you would like to proceed with this data (for instance, disassembling the
2766c92e [gemini-3.7-flash] #captured stream, writing a parser for the JSON-RPC messages, or decoding the specific bitmapping of
2766c92e [gemini-3.7-flash] #the address/control field).
2766c92e [gemini-3.7-flash] #
