278b3cbd [kimi-k3] #autopush at 32 bits, `set_fifo_join(PIO_FIFO_JOIN_RX)`, DMA reading `&pio->rxf[sm]` on the SM's RX
278b3cbd [kimi-k3] #DREQ, 32-bit transfers, write-ring mode.
278b3cbd [kimi-k3] #
278b3cbd [kimi-k3] #One design note: since the timestamp is exact, gating capture on CE (a `jmp pin` skip path,
278b3cbe [kimi-k3] #length-matched) would let a small buffer cover long real-time windows — worth considering before
278b3cbe [kimi-k3] #you commit to the ungated firehose.
278b3cbe [kimi-k3] #
