278bcf64 [glm-5.3-flash] #context question — that shape is safe from IRQ. (Related: if stdio_usb is servicing USB itself,
278bcf64 [glm-5.3-flash] #your explicit `tud_task()` calls are redundant; harmless today, but if you ever see inexplicable
278bcf64 [glm-5.3-flash] #USB state, that double-entry is suspect number one.)
