278c4db2 [grok-build-0.1] #│  2         │  Fix address bit ordering               │  Verify against actual wiring                    │
278c4db2 [grok-build-0.1] #│  3         │  Remove `reverse8()` from address path  │  Likely incorrect                                │
278c4db2 [grok-build-0.1] #│  4         │  Add proper timestamp delta handling    │  Current timestamps are just raw `time_us_64()`  │
278c4db3 [grok-build-0.1] #│  5         │  Buffer in RAM, dump in batches         │  Current per-sample `rpcSend` is extremely slow  │
278c4db3 [grok-build-0.1] #╰────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
