27a0b612 [nitro@ryzen5] can i start with just a "User Interface" node or should i go with 3d scene
27a0b6bd [grok-build-0.1] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.2 grok-build-0.1 𝕏 🪠 0.7° $0.005 9.131KB 10.22s
27a0b6bd [grok-build-0.1] #Yes, you can start with a User Interface node.
27a0b6bd [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6bd [grok-build-0.1] #Recommendation for your current stage:
27a0b6bd [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6be [grok-build-0.1] #Since you're just trying to get a basic "hello world" running, start with User Interface
27a0b6be [grok-build-0.1] #(Control node). It's simpler and more practical right now.
27a0b6be [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6be [grok-build-0.1] #Why UI is better to start with:
27a0b6bf [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6bf [grok-build-0.1] #- Easy to add a `Label` so you can actually see something on screen.
27a0b6bf [grok-build-0.1] #- Lighter than a 3D scene.
27a0b6c0 [grok-build-0.1] #- You can always add 3D nodes inside it later if needed.
27a0b6c0 [grok-build-0.1] #- Most projects (even 3D ones) have a UI root or a UI layer anyway.
27a0b6c0 [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6c0 [grok-build-0.1] #How to do it:
27a0b6c1 [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6c1 [grok-build-0.1] #1. In the editor, go to Scene → New Scene.
27a0b6c1 [grok-build-0.1] #2. Choose User Interface.
27a0b6c1 [grok-build-0.1] #3. Godot will create a `Control` node as the root.
27a0b6c2 [grok-build-0.1] #4. Attach your `main.gd` script to it.
27a0b6c2 [grok-build-0.1] #5. Save as `main.tscn`.
27a0b6c2 [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6c2 [grok-build-0.1] #Alternative options:
27a0b6c3 [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6c3 [grok-build-0.1] #╭─────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────╮
27a0b6c3 [grok-build-0.1] #│  Root Node      │  When to use                           │  Good for hello world?    │
27a0b6c3 [grok-build-0.1] #├─────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤
27a0b6c4 [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Control**    │  User Interface                        │  Yes (recommended)        │
27a0b6c4 [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Node**       │  Pure logic, no visuals                │  Yes                      │
27a0b6c4 [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Node2D**     │  2D game                               │  Okay                     │
27a0b6c4 [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Node3D**     │  3D game                               │  Only if you need 3D now  │
27a0b6c5 [grok-build-0.1] #╰─────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────╯
27a0b6c5 [grok-build-0.1] #
27a0b6c5 [grok-build-0.1] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
