27c93750 [gemini-3.8-flash] #There are three specific issues with how the DMA and samples are handled that can cause subtle
27c93751 [gemini-3.8-flash] #bugs:
27c93751 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
27c93751 [gemini-3.8-flash] #1. FIFO Leftovers and Pair Alignment
27c93751 [gemini-3.8-flash] #In `initSnoop()`, the state machine is enabled immediately (`pio_sm_set_enabled`), so the PIO
27c93752 [gemini-3.8-flash] #begins running and pushing words to the RX FIFO before capture starts.
27c93752 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
