28093d04 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28093d04 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- editor - Editor-only classes (EditorPlugin, EditorFileDialog, etc.)
28093d04 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- node - Scene tree nodes (Node2D, Node3D, Control, etc.)
28093d04 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- object - Core object types and resources
28093d05 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- resource - Asset/data resources (Mesh, Shader, Animation, etc.)
28093d05 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- variant - Built-in data types (Vector3, Transform3D, Array, etc.)
28093d05 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- globals - Global scopes (@GDScript, @GlobalScope)
28093d05 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28093d06 [claude-haiku-4-5] #• Notable aspects:*
28093d06 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28093d06 [claude-haiku-4-5] #1. Comprehensive coverage - ~1500+ documented types across categories
28093d06 [claude-haiku-4-5] #2. Clear separation between runtime nodes and editor tools
28093d07 [claude-haiku-4-5] #3. Includes modern additions like OpenXR support, Jolt physics, and XR-specific nodes
28093d07 [claude-haiku-4-5] #4. Well-organized variant types for mathematical and data operations
