28095a8c [claude-haiku-4-5] #- node: 380+ Node-derived classes
28095a8d [claude-haiku-4-5] #- object: 1000+ Object-derived classes
28095a8d [claude-haiku-4-5] #- resource: 500+ Resource-derived classes
28095a8d [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a8d [claude-haiku-4-5] #Plus variant types and globals. Well-structured metadata document.
28095a8e [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a8e [claude-haiku-4-5] #scrapegodot.txt
28095a8e [claude-haiku-4-5] #The GDScript scraper dynamically generates this schema from runtime ClassDB. Key observations:
28095a8e [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a8f [claude-haiku-4-5] #Strengths
28095a8f [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Correctly categorizes classes by parent type (Node, Resource, Object)
28095a8f [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Editor class detection via prefix matching (`Editor`, `ResourceImporter`)
28095a8f [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Generates proper method signatures with types and defaults
28095a90 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Handles variant type enumeration
28095a90 [claude-haiku-4-5] #- Outputs valid JSON
28095a90 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a90 [claude-haiku-4-5] #Potential Issues
28095a91 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a91 [claude-haiku-4-5] #1. Category Overlap: The populate_categories function adds classes to multiple lists if
28095a91 [claude-haiku-4-5] #they inherit from multiple types. For example, `EditorScript` inherits from both `Script`
28095a91 [claude-haiku-4-5] #(Resource) and potentially gets added to both categories. The schema JSON shows some classes
28095a92 [claude-haiku-4-5] #appearing in multiple sections.
28095a92 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a92 [claude-haiku-4-5] #2. Missing Globals: The scraper hardcodes `@GDScript` and `@GlobalScope` but doesn't
28095a92 [claude-haiku-4-5] #dynamically discover global functions. The schema file doesn't list individual global functions
28095a93 [claude-haiku-4-5] #either.
28095a93 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a93 [claude-haiku-4-5] #3. Type Resolution: The `getTypeName()` function handles built-in and class types, but the
28095a94 [claude-haiku-4-5] #current schema doesn't include method/property definitions—only class categorization.
28095a94 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a94 [claude-haiku-4-5] #4. Editor Detection: Prefix-based detection is reasonable but fragile. Classes like
28095a94 [claude-haiku-4-5] #`GDScriptEditorTranslationParserPlugin` would be correctly identified, but custom plugins might
28095a95 [claude-haiku-4-5] #miss.
28095a95 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a95 [claude-haiku-4-5] #Content Status
28095a95 [claude-haiku-4-5] #• Both documents appear current and consistent* with Godot 4.7.2. The schema is a snapshot;
28095a96 [claude-haiku-4-5] #the scraper would regenerate it (with likely minor differences due to the categorization logic).
28095a96 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
28095a96 [claude-haiku-4-5] #Is your goal to refine the scraper or validate the schema against a newer version?
28095a96 [claude-haiku-4-5] #
