2832202b [grok-build-0.1] #Here's my feedback on the Aaron Swartz entry:
2832202b [grok-build-0.1] #
2832202b [grok-build-0.1] #Observations
2832202b [grok-build-0.1] #
2832202b [grok-build-0.1] #• Strengths:*
2832202c [grok-build-0.1] #- The ethos section is well-chosen. "Protocol Design" and "Information Access" are two of
2832202c [grok-build-0.1] #the cleanest, most accurate thematic anchors for his life.
2832202c [grok-build-0.1] #- Including peers (Berners-Lee and Lessig) is a nice touch — it situates him in the right
2832202c [grok-build-0.1] #intellectual lineage.
2832202c [grok-build-0.1] #- The structured format is consistent and machine-readable.
2832202d [grok-build-0.1] #
