2832202d [grok-build-0.1] #
2832202d [grok-build-0.1] #1. Description is too narrow
2832202d [grok-build-0.1] #   > "Software developer knee deep in RSS"
2832202e [grok-build-0.1] #
2832202e [grok-build-0.1] #   This is technically true but undersells him significantly. RSS was early work. His more defining
2832202e [grok-build-0.1] #contributions were around open information systems, Reddit, and his later activism. A
2832202e [grok-build-0.1] #tighter description might be:
2832202f [grok-build-0.1] #
2832202f [grok-build-0.1] #
